{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08025","headline":"胡无人 · 李白","name":"胡无人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"严风吹霜海草凋，筋干精坚胡马骄。\n汉家战士三十万，将军兼领霍嫖姚。\n流星白羽腰间插，劒花秋莲光出匣。\n天兵照雪下玉关，虏箭如沙射金甲。\n云龙风虎尽交回，太白入月敌可摧。\n敌可摧，旄头灭，履胡之肠涉胡血。\n悬胡青天上，埋胡紫塞傍。\n胡无人，汉道昌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}